{"id":"wx2652803312","title":"这群爱农兴农的华农人，获新华社报道！","published_at":"2024-11-01T20:06:07+08:00","published_label":"2024-11-01","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibvwXvcVZJfj0RLfwhjF3aQJTibFicxS4tHLWfGkNBibxPmJ3kcia0G82xFUDMXkZiarEVEicCJickmzrAzw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"助力“百千万” 华农在行动 “百千万工程”是广东推进高质量发展的“头号工程”。2023年8月，广东启动实施百校联百县助力“百千万工程”的“双百行动”，目前取得了阶段性成效…","tags":["活动"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652803312&idx=2&sn=5215088ee1a852a45c3655cf32ef74ee","paper_url":null,"word_count":1242,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:48:01+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcicuf17nibODNuH43f0NBvJ232qSHXPsDwFp84pZOAZ1LjQssBzeUzt4ItDVutgOibJtm2SfHBkpt6Vg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>助力“百千万”</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>华农在行动</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><p><span>“百千万工程”是广东推进高质量发展的“头号工程”。2023年8月，广东启动实施百校联百县助力“百千万工程”的“双百行动”，目前取得了阶段性成效。</span></p><section><span>作为华南地区唯一的农林类“双一流”建设高校，华南农业大学在服务“百千万工程”中坚持当先锋、打头阵、创品牌、作示范。</span><span>近日，新华社发布纪录片</span><span>《爱农记·论文写在大地上》，聚焦华农师生服务“百千万工程”，围绕智慧无人农场、荔枝新品育种、紫金蝉茶技术帮扶等，报道华农人脚踏实地、扎根田野，以科技成果服务乡村振兴，把论文写在大地上的动人故事。相关视频也同步在新华网、央视频、凤凰新闻、学习强国等平台发布。</span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>无人农场团队</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>在水稻智慧无人农场</span></p><p><span>罗锡文院士带领团队师生</span></p><p><span>将人工智能技术与现代农机装备相结合</span></p><p><span>围绕数字化感知、智能化决策</span></p><p><span>精准化作业和智慧化管理</span></p><p><span>四大关键技术</span></p><p><span>实现“耕、种、管、收”全程智能化和智慧化</span></p><p><span>解决未来“谁来种地”的问题</span></p><p><span>2021年在广东增城无人农场</span></p><p><span>早稻种植的优质丝苗米</span></p><p><span>亩产达到662.29公斤</span></p><section><span>比当地农民种植的平均产量高出32%</span></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibvwXvcVZJfj0RLfwhjF3aQKm8XgxofczQ4Q6oCuIGeBlTtZxJtZLQXL2559fkF0reHmGM2FibaYvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><p><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652767112&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=8d048f3ff33f3cbf42de15b390c2f9b1&amp;chksm=bcd500978ba2898140bd5e7991d48420eecf858fd5d55fa96a5890da0cc4055930ae9a983de7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibvwXvcVZJfj0RLfwhjF3aQ1poxaeTzjwic3ibw7mibuTkyNMSFT5alxPx1PCPkH7hXCD5Y98I15gOZQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></a></p><p><span>点击图片了解更多</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>荔枝科研团队</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>在从化荔枝园<br/></span></p><p><span>经过老中青几代人</span></p><p><span>近四十年的接力攻关</span></p><p><span>园艺学院荔枝科研团队取得一系列创新成果</span></p><p><span>通过共建荔枝现代农业产业园</span></p><p><span>成立华南农业大学荔枝研究院</span></p><p><span>设立荔枝专家工作站等方式</span></p><p><span>支撑了一批农业龙头企业的发展</span></p><p><span>此外，团队人员还深入荔枝产区</span></p><p><span>为一线的农户开展技术培训</span></p><p><span>助力荔枝从“小特产”升级为“大产业”</span></p><section><span>推动产业兴旺和乡村全面振兴</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibvwXvcVZJfj0RLfwhjF3aQ4Rv2e3HEnA0Z2ULvtQTrxCPKJcsxJPWTeWWxpmTfChWiabnq3m3TibiaQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652688089&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=75c6b3dc87970c4d4466bb2f8372d95c&amp;chksm=bcd7cdc68ba044d08401d4a6cbd10b52e551e1bcb70820f81b4b632dcb8e240a906cf0e39baf&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibvwXvcVZJfj0RLfwhjF3aQ1libRhSGVZVyXcFicqib32IAlMIg4Wg2dwgbUUcicDiaiaYacZtWu4c3sZaA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><span>点击图片了解更多</span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>紫金蝉茶团队</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>河源紫金县里</span><br/></p><p><span>被虫咬过的茶叶“紫金蝉茶”</span></p><p><span>茶汤蜜香馥郁、喉韵回甘</span></p><p><span>是有名的“土特产”</span></p><p><span>“双百行动”中华农与河源紫金县</span></p><p><span>开展结对共建</span></p><p><span>瞄准紫金县特色蝉茶产业</span></p><p><span>组建茶树育种、栽培、加工、植物保护等</span></p><p><span>全产业链专家团队</span></p><p><span>创新性开展了一系列紫金蝉茶</span></p><p><span>提质增效新技术的研究</span></p><p><span>深度构建紫金蝉茶全产业链帮扶模式</span></p><section><span>助力紫金“土特产”做出“大文章”</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibvwXvcVZJfj0RLfwhjF3aQralDQias0mfTYRbJhs4eoWG6WVBWib0PrttOtBK4V4t0Z79bDLpsibYDA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652779457&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e066a7d892a5e6ad6c248c2b547767ed&amp;chksm=bcd530de8ba2b9c82b514c2edebf1150bef39b651459074c2dd4652757e76d74e06376755f71&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibvwXvcVZJfj0RLfwhjF3aQibG2kTQlSuZMiaPFk4nH2kGp810AwliaibmQNiciak20ib4KxxMXVyYSXa2UQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></a></p><section><span>点击图片了解更多</span></section><p><span>“百千万行动”实施以来</span></p><p><span>华农充分发挥自身学科优势</span></p><p><span>和紧密联系“三农”的传统优势</span></p><p><span>把“人才链”建在“产业链”上</span></p><p><span>围绕“产业链”部署“创新链”</span></p><p><span>并牵头组建“双百行动”乡村产业发展高校联盟</span></p><p><span>先后选派科技特派团、科技特派员</span></p><p><span>农技推广轻骑兵等</span></p><p><span>深入农业产业生产一线</span></p><p><span>助力破解产业技术发展难题</span></p><p><span>打造“永根科技站”</span></p><p><span>成为“专家团队+农业企业”的创新联合体</span></p><p><span>设立农业硕士“兴农”创新班</span></p><p><span>组织师生开展“万名学子乡村大调研”</span></p><p><span>充分发挥学科建设和人才优势</span></p><section><span>为乡村全面振兴增势赋能</span></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8TWuC9D6Q9aDbnFjbFU8cbdZfyYc7zd0eFwiaspK38sSbWWUancSaY1enMv6uS7fBmzuwG4OuKvRg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\"/></span></section><section><span>走进华农，爱农兴农</span></section><section><span>百年名校，培根铸魂</span></section><section><span>以农为本，教育报国</span></section><section><span>让教育普惠乡村发展</span></section><section><span>以科研助力“百千万工程”</span></section><section><span>师生同心 一脉传承</span></section><section><span>让时代论文写在大地上</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fJPwmSRBYeNFIJN8WDicrsh5n3Fff5qO3bpMGllj4Zf8bfibxq9FETR9klu27K9LFTbEugvqibYm9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></p><section><section><section><p><strong>▶ 往期回顾</strong></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652783033&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=af74b3b3d9f3ae0b5c34b55d01a4679d&amp;chksm=bcd542a68ba2cbb0f7e301ac2ba8e10e5c348a2da2d20e0d20b4cd8b4cfe5e1df1bfe76631c8&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcicQk7m3fiaiaV8am1Buia63zhmOVcTu40SFdS6SzWYoibnwYaaNI3fOicHBYiaiaLqed3qlEEVCXGzX2ppjA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p>▲ “头号工程”打头阵！</p></section></section><sect